qmlcachegen compiles QML to bytecode only. The C++ it otherwise generates calls Qt's private QML API,
which ties the binary to the exact Qt version it was built with.

diff --git a/crates/qt-build-utils/src/tool/qmlcachegen.rs b/crates/qt-build-utils/src/tool/qmlcachegen.rs
